       72  ==Demographics==
       73  According to the [[2024 Moldovan census|2024 census]], 50,429 inhabitants lived in Edineț District, a decrease compared to the previous census in 2014, when 71,849 inhabitants were registered. {{cite web|url=https://statistica.gov.md/ro/rezultatele-finale-ale-recensamantului-populatiei-si-locuintelo
